{title: Wonderful Words of Life}
{artist: Philip P. Bliss}
{genre: Gospel}
{style: Traditional}
{flow: Response}
{key: F}
{tempo: 88}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Sing them over a[C7]gain to [F]me
Wonderful words of [C7]life
Let me [F]more of their [Bb]beauty [F]see
Wonderful [C7]words of [F]life
Words of [Bb]life and [F]beauty
Teach me [C7]faith and [F]duty
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[F]Beautiful words, [Bb]wonderful [F]words
[C7]Wonderful words of [F]life
[F]Beautiful words, [Bb]wonderful [F]words
[C7]Wonderful words of [F]life
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Christ, the blessed [C7]One, gives to [F]all
Wonderful words of [C7]life
[F]Sinner, list to the [Bb]loving [F]call
Wonderful [C7]words of [F]life
All so [Bb]freely [F]given
Wooing [C7]us to [F]heaven
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Sweetly echo the [C7]gospel [F]call
Wonderful words of [C7]life
[F]Offer pardon and [Bb]peace to [F]all
Wonderful [C7]words of [F]life
Jesus, [Bb]only [F]Saviour
Sancti[C7]fy for[F]ever
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
